**Privacy policy**

This privacy policy outlines our privacy practices. We value your privacy and respect your right to keep your personal information confidential.


We don’t collect any personal or personally identifiable information about our app users. However, we may collect some anonymous usage statistics within our apps to help us improve our apps and services.

Users who contact us via email do so at their own discretion and voluntarily provide any personal information. We emphasize that users have the autonomy to choose what information they disclose, and they do so at their own risk. Nevertheless, we strictly adhere to privacy and do not sell, share, or disclose any personal information to third parties.
